// The MDDRC (AXI + QoSBuf + DMC) of the Hi3516A V200 and Hi3519 V101 is the shared block
// rdl/common/HISI_MDDRC.rdl (eHISI_MDDRC, generated from the Hi3516A V200 data sheet chapter 4.1; the
// Hi3519 V101 chapter is identical). This file only keeps the historical include name used by the chip
// file. Instantiate as `eHISI_MDDRC DDRC @ 0x12060000;` (AXI +0x0, QoSBuf +0x4000, DMC0 +0x8000).
`include "../common/HISI_MDDRC.rdl"
